Kev-0.8B for LiteRT

The LiteRT graphs and the head file in this repository are converted from jaredpalmer/kev-0.8b, tag v1.0 (commit
bf75a6a8848ea6960ff2ed108d9ed44c2941174f), by Jared Palmer, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(https://huggingface.co/jaredpalmer/kev-0.8b): its LoRA adapter folded into the base weights in float32, and its
pointer head. tokenizer/tokenizer.json and tokenizer/tokenizer_config.json are that repository's files, unchanged. The
base model is Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Base (revision dc7cdfe2ee4154fa7e30f5b51ca41bfa40174e68),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Base).

host/kev_litert.py ports the request handling of the kev package at tag kev-1.0 (github.com/jaredpalmer/kev, Apache
License 2.0): kev.api.render, option_text, to_record and to_answers, and the row form of kev.model.encode with the
pointer-head readout. Changes include float32 readout arithmetic in numpy, fixed graph lengths, and rejection of rows
that do not fit instead of truncation.

conversion/kev_qwen35_patch.py is adapted from a patch for the Qwen3.5 export in litert-torch (Copyright 2026 The
LiteRT Torch Authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0); its header states the changes. conversion/kev_graph.py
wraps the Qwen3.5 text model of transformers (Apache License 2.0). The conversion used litert-torch, ai-edge-quantizer
and LiteRT (ai-edge-litert), each licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The SemIf records of fixtures/requests_public.json come from SemIf benchmarks/data/authored144.jsonl
(github.com/TheoLeeCJ/SemIf, commit ca3ba65f), Copyright (c) 2026 TheoLeeCJ, licensed under the MIT License
(fixtures/LICENSE-SemIf-MIT.txt). The records taken from the kev repository's transfer-v4 development file are listed
by reference only; fixtures/rebuild_requests.py restores them from that repository.

The conversion scripts, the Python host, the example and the Kotlin block in this repository are licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).
